@startuml
title SMS Delivery Callback - Business Process with Request Throttling

actor "SMS Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Request Throttler" as Throttler
participant "SMS Callback Service" as Service
database "Oracle RAC" as RAC
participant "Audit / Logging" as Audit

Gateway -> Throttler: POST /bmg/callback/delivery

Throttler -> Throttler: Check configured\nconcurrency limit

alt Concurrency capacity available

    Throttler -> Throttler: Increment active request count

    Throttler -> Service: Forward callback

    Service -> Service: Authenticate request

    alt Authentication successful

        Service -> Service: Validate callback

        alt Validation successful

            Service -> Audit: Log callback received

            Service -> RAC: Lookup record by UMID

            alt UMID found

                RAC --> Service: Matching record

                Service -> RAC: Update delivery status
                RAC --> Service: Update successful

                Service -> Audit: Log successful update

                Service --> Throttler: HTTP 200 + "success"

            else UMID not found

                RAC --> Service: No matching record

                Service -> Audit: Log unmatched UMID

                Service --> Throttler: HTTP 200 + "success"

            else RAC unavailable / timeout

                RAC --> Service: Database failure

                Service -> Audit: Log database failure

                Service --> Throttler: HTTP 500

            end

        else Validation failed

            Service -> Audit: Log validation failure
            Service --> Throttler: HTTP 400

        end

    else Authentication failed

        Service -> Audit: Log authentication failure
        Service --> Throttler: HTTP 401

    end

    Throttler -> Throttler: Decrement active request count

    Throttler --> Gateway: Response

else Concurrency limit exceeded

    Throttler -> Throttler: Apply configured\nqueue/rejection policy

    alt Request queued

        Throttler -> Throttler: Wait for available\nconcurrency slot
        Throttler -> Service: Forward callback

    else Request rejected

        Throttler --> Gateway: Throttler response\n(e.g. 429)

    end

end

@enduml